&lt;p data-start=&quot;581&quot; data-end=&quot;745&quot;&gt;Own your territory &amp;amp; build pipeline: Develop and execute a proactive outbound cadence (email, call, social) that generates ≥50 % of your booked opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
